# Web container runtime config (nginx serving the SPA; /config.js): /srv/iltiam/env/<staging|production>/web.env
# Runbook: docs/runbooks/04-secrets.md. Inventory, owners and rotation: docs/secrets.md.
#
# This template holds NO values. Each NAME= line is filled from the GitHub Environment variable of the same name by
# scripts/render-env.sh. Nothing here is secret: everything the web app receives is readable in any browser.
# TO CONFIRM with WEB-03 (iltiam/iltiam-web#25): the runtime /config.js is not built yet and the variable names
# below are proposed. Today the app only reads the build-time VITE_API_URL (web/src/api/client.ts).

# --- Runtime config ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# var, required: API base URL, https://staging-api.<DOMAIN>/api or https://api.<DOMAIN>/api; name TO CONFIRM (WEB-03).
API_BASE_URL=
# var, required: public Cloudflare Turnstile site key of this environment's widget; name TO CONFIRM (WEB-03).
TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
